      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXTREME BLUE (7) jumps from box 7 for the first time after placing latest at this track (17.40) in a Grade 4/5. Has never missed the frame here from five starts. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Likely to feature again. BUGLE GIRL (2) missed the hat-trick last start when third and beaten 3.5 lengths (17.42) last time at this track. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Can feature again. ROCKING ROMA (1) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 300m behind Amazing Bundy (17.78) in a Grade 5. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Deserves plenty of respect. DOLLAR ROLEX (8) cannot be left out over a shorter trip.",
